{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is nearby, approach and take it. If not, scan area. Finally, perform a specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
